			"notes": "# 12th Client 1.1.4\n\n## Added MANY MANY things!\n\n### 1. New Module and Organizing System\n### 2. New World Renderer and many new Cheats\n### 3. Window Engine with many Widgets\n### 4. RenderUtils, Shader etc.\n\n### A complete list of all Features (36):\n - Aimbot (Combat)\n - Auto Armor (Combat)\n - Auto Clicker (Combat)\n - Auto Cobweb (Combat)\n - Auto Totem (Combat) [needs fixes]\n - Ciritcals (Combat)\n - Entity ESP (Combat) [without depth soon]\n - Trigger Bot (Combat)\n\n - Better Chat (Misc)\n - Better Scoreboard (Misc)\n - Item Display (Misc)\n - Jump to Food (Misc) [still there because it was the first ever feature]\n - Keystrokes (Misc)\n - Stealth Mode (Misc) \n\n - Anti AFK (Movement)\n - Anti Web (Movement)\n - Baritone Module (Movement) [only for testing; does nothing]\n - No Slow (Movement)\n\n - Anti Knockback (Player)\n - Auto Refill (Player)\n - Auto Tool (Player)\n - Chest Stealer (Player)\n - Freecam (Player) [doesnt work]\n - Ghost Hand (Player)\n\n - Chest ESP/Storage ESP (Render) [Uses new Renderer]\n - Compass HUD (Render) [still in development]\n - Entity Culling (Render)\n - Fullbright (Render)\n - Hide Explosion Particle (Render)\n - Hide Totem Animation (Render)\n - Item Rotation Settings (Render) \n - Motion Blur (Render) [IMPORTANT [IRIS](#iris-important)]\n - No Damage Tilt (Render)\n - Player ESP (Uses new Renderer)\n - Projectile Ding (Render)\n - Projectile Trail (Render)\n - Trail Settings (Render)\n\n## Iris Important\n### The Motion Blur uses a Jar Shader loader which loads a Shader out of the Clients Jar.\n### Please add the Mods Iris and Sodium first."
		},
